{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The spec requires receipts to preserve historical close decisions, while voluntary negative reviews must still block an exemption. I’m tracing those paths, including recovery when a roadmap is marked done but has no receipt."}}
