] 600.0s pose-mcp/test\n[time] 200.6s pose-mcp/governance-read-view-integration\n[time] 199.2s pose-mcp/delegation-surface-integration\n[time] 156.0s pose-mcp/milestone-review-proportional-integration\n[time] 124.0s pose-mcp/milestone-closes-when-reached-integration\n213 step(s) · 212 pass · 1 error · 599.1s\nResult: FAILURE — required check failed\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
